                <pb facs="1032" n="938" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg938"/>

                <head>No. 574.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Viscount das Nogueiras to Mr.
                        Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Portugal</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 25, 1887</date>.
                        (Received May 28.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to the note you did me the honor
                    to address to me on the 19th instant, in regard to the passport demanded of Mr.
                    Watson by the Portuguese vice-consul at Boston, I hasten to inform you that
                    orders have been given to prevent such mistakes in future.</p>
                <p>Pray accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Viscount das
                    Nogueiras.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
